# Intervention Maps · typography and pre-publish

Apply when creating, editing, or publishing pages under `intervention-maps/`.

## Line-break hygiene (display type)

Short words must not sit alone at the end of a wrapped display line.

Common offenders in titles and leads: **A**, **I**, **An**, **To**, **Of**, **Or**, **And** (when they start a short final phrase).

**Fix:** bind the short word to what follows with a non-breaking space:

- `A landscape` → `A&nbsp;landscape`
- `a map` → `a&nbsp;map`
- `Not a menu.` can stay; bind the next phrase: `A&nbsp;landscape`

**Check at:** desktop (~1100px), tablet (~768px), and phone (~390px). Resize until the title wraps. If a one-letter or two-letter word is stranded at the end of a line, bind it.

Also avoid:

- One word alone on the last line of a multi-line display title when an `&nbsp;` or slight copy tweak can prevent it
- Em dashes (project em-dash policy)

## Pre-publish checklist

Run before calling Intervention Maps ready to ship or after a material landing/condition pass:

1. **Chrome:** No `noindex`, no `ev-draft` / sketch banners on public pages.
2. **Identity:** Top bar says Intervention Maps; crumbs link home correctly; titles use `· Intervention Maps | Rajiv Vakani`.
3. **SEO / sitemap (required):** Every new or promoted public page has description, canonical, OG/Twitter tags, and a matching `sitemap.xml` entry. Follow `seo-sitemap-before-publish.mdc`. Do not call the series live until this is done.
4. **Typography:** Display titles and hero leads pass the line-break check above at three widths.
5. **Mobile:** First viewport, dark landscape band, condition plates, and topic pages readable; tap targets not cramped; no horizontal scroll.
6. **Footer:** Every public page includes `.ev-site-foot` (disclaimer + © + social).
7. **Series foot:** Topic pages keep the in-product `.ev-foot` back-link above the site footer.
8. **CSS:** If `sketch.css` changed, bump `?v=` on every Intervention Maps HTML page.
9. **Links:** Condition plates, contact suggest link, and `../index.html` / `../contact.html` resolve.
10. **Em dashes:** None in public copy (period / comma / colon / rewrite).

## Scope note

`evidence/` is backstage (methodology, mockups). Public room is `intervention-maps/` only.
